WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:20.982
Aw! You're cute!

2
00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:25.337
Who are you?

3
00:00:25.338 --> 00:00:29.023
I'm a ladybug.

4
00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:32.451
We're small beetles.

5
00:00:32.452 --> 00:00:36.433
Beetles are insects.

6
00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:40.266
Where do you live?

7
00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:46.536
Ladybugs live all over the world.

8
00:00:46.537 --> 00:00:52.299
We like forests, rivers, and even houses.

9
00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:58.942
Some people call us "ladybirds" or "lady beetles."

10
00:00:58.943 --> 00:01:02.259
What do you eat?

11
00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:06.267
We like bugs that eat plants.

12
00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:11.784
So farmers love ladybugs.

13
00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:15.724
We protect their crops!

14
00:01:15.725 --> 00:01:21.476
You're bright red!

15
00:01:21.477 --> 00:01:28.669
Ladybugs are usually red, yellow, or orange.

16
00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:32.232
Some ladybugs have stripes.

17
00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:37.434
But most have black spots like mine.

18
00:01:37.435 --> 00:01:41.121
Why do you have those spots?

19
00:01:41.122 --> 00:01:46.262
Our spots and bright colors keep enemies away.

20
00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:51.913
They warn animals that we taste bad!

21
00:01:51.914 --> 00:01:55.861
Who are your enemies?

22
00:01:55.862 --> 00:01:59.832
Birds sometimes eat ladybugs.

23
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:05.502
So do frogs, spiders, and dragonflies.

24
00:02:05.503 --> 00:02:08.774
Do you sleep during winter?

25
00:02:08.775 --> 00:02:16.369
Yes. We sleep under rocks or inside old logs.

26
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:23.870
Sometimes we go into houses to get warm.

27
00:02:23.871 --> 00:02:29.005
Did you see my wings?

28
00:02:29.006 --> 00:02:35.106
Look! I can fly!

29
00:02:35.107 --> 00:02:42.545
Bye, Ladybug!
